I can add three small ReLU layers to adjust urgency and keep the existing weights unchanged. The switch will work at every representable input in the supplied Python evaluator, including confidence = 0.4. A finite ReLU network cannot make an exact discontinuous switch over all real numbers. I will record that limit in NOTES.md.
